{"id":"27d9efd53f614967","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-tarski-variety.md","title":"Tarski's Theorem on Varieties","display":"Tarski's Theorem on Varieties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-tarski-variety","aliases":["93-thm-tarski-variety"],"display":"Tarski's Theorem on Varieties","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-tarski-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-tarski-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Tarski's Theorem on Varieties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-tarski-variety-—-Tarski's-Theorem-on-Varieties\">thm-tarski-variety — Tarski's Theorem on Varieties</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span> is a family in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\\)</span> is the constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}variety}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathbf A(i)\\in\\mathcal V)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal V.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}variety}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathbf A(i)\\in\\mathcal V)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal V.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Varieties are closed under ultraproducts because equations are preserved by Łoś's theorem.  Ultraproduct closure alone does not characterize varieties; HSP closure does.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-tarski-variety-—-Tarski's-Theorem-on-Varieties","text":"thm-tarski-variety — Tarski's Theorem on Varieties","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"ta